  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you today?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty busy, but good.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is it better to study in the morning or late at night?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.25,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "studying.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It depends on you. Most people focus best a few hours after waking up, but some genuinely do their best work at night.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.96,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm definitely a night person. But my exam is at nine in the morning.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 1.48,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "studying.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then shift your schedule a little earlier over the next week, so your brain is awake at nine on the day.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 1.02,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How early are we talking?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.99,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "studying.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Try going to bed and waking up about half an hour earlier every couple of days. And do a few practice questions around nine each morning.",
   "est_sec": 8.16,
   "gap_before": 1.02,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That's sneaky. I",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.65,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "studying.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "actually like that.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.42,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "studying.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It's a nice way to rehearse the real thing. You'll feel much less groggy on exam day.",
